1
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:52,359
Mr. Shi,

2
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:54,400
I read in the news

3
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,920
that you were very successful at Shenzhen headquarters.

4
00:01:57,439 --> 00:01:58,159
Why did you suddenly

5
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,560
ask to be transferred to Honggang?

6
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,439
Honggang has great policies,

7
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,319
and strong support from the leadership.

8
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,760
I used to build my career here,

9
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,599
so I still have feelings for it.

10
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,519
What kind of people do you like working with?

11
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:08,680
Capable ones.

12
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,000
Yet what I value even more

13
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,280
are chemistry and trust.

14
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,919
I'm quite firm on that point.

15
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:15,599
In the first bidding for the Smart Port,

16
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:18,120
why did you withdraw?

17
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:24,639
There's a lot of speculation out there.

18
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,680
It depends on which version you believe.

19
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,439
What's beyond doubt

20
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:30,840
is that the Smart Port is Honggang's crown jewel.

21
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,960
Everything Tengyue does

22
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,479
is all for this crown jewel.

23
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,120
Meifan,

24
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,479
the control room says they're ready.

25
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,439
Okay, coming right away.

26
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,159
Let's head over.

27
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:41,599
Let's go.

28
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,560
Yet with your drastic moves, Mr. Shi,

29
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,840
you've offended everyone.

30
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,159
I fear frost will form before the jewel can shine.

31
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,319
From what you're saying,

32
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,400
you seem to be hinting at something.

33
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,840
I forgot to introduce myself.

34
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,599
Sai Xiuliang is my husband.

35
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,080
Actually, I've wanted to find a chance

36
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,080
to talk with you for a while.

37
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,000
What about?

38
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,639
No wonder after all this talk,

39
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:08,080
you didn't follow the interview outline.

40
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,439
Turns out you want to stand up for your husband.

41
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,599
To be frank,

42
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,639
that's indeed my intention.

43
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,680
Xiuliang feels awkward asking directly,

44
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:17,639
but I think some things

45
00:03:17,759 --> 00:03:18,800
are better brought out in the open.

46
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,919
He helped you out before,

47
00:03:21,479 --> 00:03:22,960
and he really wants to work with Tengyue.

48
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,039
Still, I don't know

49
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,560
if you still have reservations, Mr. Shi.

50
00:03:26,919 --> 00:03:27,400
Miss Yang,

51
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,039
may I take the liberty of asking,

52
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,680
how did you and Sai Xiuliang get together?

53
00:03:35,759 --> 00:03:37,280
That doesn't seem quite relevant

54
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,520
to what we were discussing.

55
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:40,319
Here's why.

56
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,560
At first glance,

57
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:44,159
you're a lady from an educated family,

58
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,240
while he

59
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:46,879
is the son of a contractor.

60
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:49,199
Your backgrounds are worlds apart,

61
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:50,199
yet you ended up together.

62
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,639
I'm very curious to understand that.

63
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,080
It seems you've done

64
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,560
a lot of homework, Mr. Shi.

65
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,199
Learning about potential partners

66
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,840
is just basic prudence.

67
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,039
In my view,

68
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,120
we can't choose our origins,

69
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:09,639
but we can choose the path we take.

70
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,000
Both my family and I

71
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,759
trust Xiuliang's competence and integrity.

72
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,840
Since you've done

73
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,279
so much homework on him,

74
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,399
it means you're still quite interested in him.

75
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,439
Excuse me, let me take this call.

76
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:30,319
Mr. Wei.

77
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,439
Mr. Shi, it's me.

78
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,040
Well...

79
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,240
I'm calling to let you know...

80
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:36,879
Well,

81
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,720
about Changfu Construction...

82
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,600
I've decided not to sell.

83
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,600
Why?

84
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,519
Why the sudden change of heart?

85
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:47,920
Well,

86
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,800
I thought about it,

87
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:51,759
and I just can't bear to let it go.

88
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,480
After all these years,

89
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,720
it just doesn't feel right.

90
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,160
Are you right now

91
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,600
with Brother Ma and Brother Xi?

92
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,000
Yes.

93
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:10,120
The three old brothers sat down and had a talk.

94
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:12,319
After all these years together,

95
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,480
walking away and leaving them behind...

96
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,000
I just...

97
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,319
I really can't bring myself to do it.

98
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:28,959
Mr. Shi.

99
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,439
Send my regards to both brothers.

100
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:34,959
Will do, definitely.

101
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:36,759
They're actually right here with me.

102
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,319
I've got you on speaker.

103
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,639
Brother Ma wasn't well a while back,

104
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:42,639
and I couldn't find the time to visit.

105
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:44,560
How's Brother Xi doing these days?

106
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,360
I'm not...

107
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,199
Well...

108
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,439
Uh, Huzi...

109
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,000
Wait, Mr. Shi,

110
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:58,639
it's Ma Jiucheng.

111
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,720
Thank you for thinking of me.

112
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,000
I... I'm recovering quite well now.

113
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,360
Xizi is doing pretty well too.

114
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:06,399
That's good.

115
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,879
That's good.

116
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,879
Let's get together sometime, okay?

117
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,959
Thank you. Thank you so much.

118
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:13,879
Thank you, Mr. Shi.

119
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:15,439
All right then.

120
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:16,680
Goodbye.

121
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,120
That's great!

122
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:28,160
We managed to push them back.

123
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,000
Let Huzi see it too.

124
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,079
The three old brothers haven't fallen apart yet!

125
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,319
Shi Yongnian pushing us like this

126
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,360
actually sparked an idea in me.

127
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,879
If the three of us fight alone,

128
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,160
none of us can beat Tengyue.

129
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:50,480
But if our three teams unite,

130
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,439
merging into one,

131
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:53,920
and pulling together,

132
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,439
no one can break us apart.

133
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,600
You mean...

134
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,000
Merge?

135
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:00,800
Exactly.

136
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,600
I won't run my company on my own anymore.

137
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,279
Brother Wei,

138
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:05,920
if you're willing,

139
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:07,879
let me buy some shares,

140
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,439
and let Old Ma have a share too.

141
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,160
That way,

142
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,199
we'll have retirement money down the road,

143
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,519
and we can also

144
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:16,519
leave a livelihood for our kids.

145
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,439
That's—that's wonderful!

146
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,000
I'm all for this idea!

147
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,199
Once we merge,

148
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:21,600
who would we even be afraid of?

149
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,040
Seriously!

150
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:22,839
No, no, no.

151
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:23,720
Old Ma,

152
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:24,839
Xizi,

153
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,920
calm down.

154
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,839
Think about the three of us.

155
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,199
How old are we now?

156
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,319
How many more years can we work?

157
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:32,079
Right?

158
00:07:32,639 --> 00:07:35,000
Holding onto what we have is good enough.

159
00:07:35,279 --> 00:07:35,680
Isn't it?

160
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,879
The three of us are old,

161
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:39,439
but we still have our kids!

162
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:41,959
Look at my second son.

163
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:45,000
He refuses to work for the government anymore,

164
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,959
but he's got a sharp mind.

165
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,959
Let him manage the business.

166
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,879
And my eldest son,

167
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,600
he's worked on construction sites since childhood.

168
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:54,439
He knows the ropes inside out.

169
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:55,879
I'm telling both of you,

170
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,360
as long as I can still move,

171
00:07:57,920 --> 00:08:00,560
I'll carry the kids and keep pushing forward!

172
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:09,279
Well...

173
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,759
Old Ma, Xizi,

174
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,279
your...

175
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,319
your spirit is admirable.

176
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,240
But merging three teams,

177
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,800
that's too big a move.

178
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,079
I think

179
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:23,120
things are just fine as they are.

180
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,920
I can still secure projects,

181
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,319
and when work comes in,

182
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,519
you two get first priority.

183
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:29,639
You don't have to shoulder any risk,

184
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,279
and you can still earn a decent buck.

185
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,200
That's pretty good, right?

186
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:32,759
Isn't it?

187
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:41,440
Right.

188
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:42,440
Yeah.

189
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,639
There's no rush on this anyway.

190
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,279
We can talk it over later.

191
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:47,720
We'll take our time discussing it.

192
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,320
Still, today,

193
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,639
we pushed Shi Yongnian back,

194
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,720
and that calls for a drink!

195
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:54,679
Right, exactly!

196
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,080
Let him know

197
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,960
that even if the three of us are old,

198
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:59,759
we're not people to mess with!

199
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:01,120
Come on.

200
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:01,879
Cheers!

201
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:02,559
Come on, cheers!

202
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,480
Old Ma, you...

203
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,559
Just—just take a sip.

204
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,600
Just to join in.

205
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:06,000
Cheers!

206
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,480
One, two, three. One, two, three.

207
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:17,480
How's the sound?

208
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:18,080
Sounds good.

209
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:19,039
Great.

210
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:19,759
Thank you.

211
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,720
Ms. Yang,

212
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,960
whenever you have time,

213
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,720
I'd still like to meet with your husband.

214
00:09:27,519 --> 00:09:28,080
Attorney Sai,

215
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,120
I've thought it over.

216
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:30,480
You're right.

217
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,399
A company like ours,

218
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:33,159
being new here,

219
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,720
really needs

220
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,279
a lawyer familiar with local business

221
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:38,200
to protect our interests.

222
00:09:40,919 --> 00:09:41,200
All right.

223
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,919
I'll have him contact you.

224
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:43,679
Thank you.

225
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,639
Brother Mingming! Brother Mingming!

226
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:09,720
Inspection's here! Quick!

227
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:11,759
Put your hard hats on!

228
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,000
Why are they here?

229
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:22,720
Inspect thoroughly and responsibly.

230
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,279
Don't miss a single detail.

231
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:24,679
Understood?

232
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:25,600
Understood. Understood.

233
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,039
Go on.

234
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:28,840
Manager Chen.

235
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:29,759
What's... what's...

236
00:10:30,559 --> 00:10:32,080
What's going on here?

237
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,360
The group is conducting spot checks on the site.

238
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,519
Don't worry. Just go about your work.

239
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:36,399
If we need your cooperation,

240
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:37,200
I'll let you know.

241
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,480
Where's your hard hat?

242
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,639
I'm the accountant.

243
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:40,840
Accountants don't wear hard hats.

244
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,879
Go, go get one right now!

245
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,240
Why isn't anyone wearing a hard hat?

246
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,159
Why don't you have a hard hat on?

247
00:10:50,159 --> 00:10:50,720
What's going on?

248
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,519
Not even wearing hard hats!

249
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:53,320
Don't you know workplace safety regulations?

250
00:10:58,879 --> 00:10:59,279
26.

251
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:00,799
32.

252
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:03,679
Pressure loss and rust. Failed.

253
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,320
Exterior wall clearance. Failed.

254
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,960
Scaffolding not built to code.

255
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,679
Hollow wall detected. Failed.

256
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,039
Drainpipe diameter. Failed.

257
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,399
Wall thickness. Failed.

258
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,200
Insufficient water pressure. Failed.

259
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:21,559
Section Chief Sai.

260
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,759
Sorry to keep you waiting.

261
00:11:23,039 --> 00:11:23,679
My apologies.

262
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:25,679
You're a busy man, Mr. Shi.

263
00:11:26,279 --> 00:11:27,279
The fact that you reached out to meet me

264
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,480
is already an honor.

265
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:29,879
Waiting a little while

266
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,440
is nothing.

267
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:31,799
From the sound of it,

268
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:32,840
you're still holding a grudge.

269
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:35,200
Still blaming me for burning bridges last time?

270
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,799
What you do, Mr. Shi,

271
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:38,960
is build roads and bridges

272
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,320
for Honggang.

273
00:11:41,639 --> 00:11:42,879
Why would you have time

274
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,320
to burn down my little footbridge?

275
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,559
You two really are

276
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:49,480
cut from the same cloth.

277
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,679
You and your wife,

278
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:52,320
each sharper-tongued than the other.

279
00:11:53,039 --> 00:11:53,879
We spoke last time,

280
00:11:54,279 --> 00:11:55,960
and I think you were right about one thing.

281
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:57,639
Local business

282
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,159
should be handled by locals.

283
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,399
I really do want

284
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:02,000
to hand our legal representation to you.

285
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,600
But look at you right now.

286
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,879
You hold office, working for the government.

287
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,759
We can only talk personal feelings,

288
00:12:07,759 --> 00:12:08,919
not business.

289
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,200
You know that better than I do.

290
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,440
Mr. Shi,

291
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:12,840
regarding my resignation,

292
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,480
I'm just waiting for the leaders' approval.

293
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:18,600
That's great news!

294
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,679
That means between you and me,

295
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:21,519
everything is on the table now.

296
00:12:22,639 --> 00:12:22,919
Good.

297
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,519
Here's the deal, Attorney Sai.

298
00:12:25,039 --> 00:12:25,960
Tengyue Group

299
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:27,799
wants to acquire a local construction firm.

300
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:30,080
If you can help me

301
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:30,919
close this deal,

302
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,759
then I can certainly consider

303
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,080
handing our legal representation

304
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,399
entirely over to you.

305
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:41,519
Mr. Shi,

306
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:44,200
that's actually our law firm's core specialty.

307
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,399
Leave this matter to me,

308
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,080
and you have nothing to worry about.

309
00:12:49,799 --> 00:12:52,120
Don't assume this is going to be easy.

310
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,279
We already held a round of talks.

311
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,000
We were about to sign,

312
00:12:56,679 --> 00:12:57,639
and they backed out at the last minute.

313
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,480
I'm confident I can do it.

314
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,159
Mr. Shi wants to

315
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:20,399
acquire Changfu.

316
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,879
Come take a look for yourselves.

317
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:39,639
Corner insulation hollow rate is too high.

318
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:41,039
Scaffolding, safety netting...

319
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,000
Required rectifications weren't made.

320
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:45,200
Debris is piled up in the fire exit.

321
00:13:45,559 --> 00:13:45,879
And another thing:

322
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:47,879
where's the emergency lighting?

323
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,279
You were told to fix these issues before.

324
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:53,960
Why hasn't a single person followed up?

325
00:13:54,159 --> 00:13:55,279
Whose fault is this, exactly?

326
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:57,720
Whose fault is it?!

327
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,000
Mr. Chen.

328
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:02,960
Manager.

329
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:03,799
General Manager Chen.

330
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:06,279
If I may be so bold...

331
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,000
Regarding this matter,

332
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,799
the supervisor already signed off on it.

333
00:14:09,039 --> 00:14:10,360
And we've already been paid in full.

334
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,240
About this matter...

335
00:14:12,519 --> 00:14:13,039
Let me tell you:

336
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,399
if you can do the job, do it.

337
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,200
If you can't,

338
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:16,080
shut it down!

339
00:14:16,799 --> 00:14:17,120
Wait, no...

340
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:17,519
Mr. Chen...

341
00:14:17,639 --> 00:14:18,840
From now on, we... we'll just...

342
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:19,399
What're you getting at?

343
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,679
Still want your money, huh?

344
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:21,600
Let me tell you:

345
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:22,600
you won't get a single penny!

346
00:14:24,159 --> 00:14:25,000
Look at this mess...

347
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:25,519
Mr. Chen,

348
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,480
let's talk this over.

349
00:14:30,759 --> 00:14:31,600
What's the situation?

350
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,799
Aren't you close with Wei Changfu?

351
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:37,840
Yes.

352
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:40,120
He's an old pal of my dad's.

353
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,440
Then you're the right person for this.

354
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:43,399
Here's the plan.

355
00:14:43,919 --> 00:14:44,840
Go draft a contract.

356
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,639
Here's 500,000.

357
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,799
Consider it a deposit.

358
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:55,480
Mr. Shi, the contract isn't signed yet.

359
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:57,080
It wouldn't be right for me to take the money.

360
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,799
Are you lacking confidence in yourself,

361
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:01,320
or doubting my sincerity?

362
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:07,639
Mr. Shi,

363
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:09,799
since

364
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,399
Changfu isn't interested in being acquired,

365
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:15,440
why not consider acquiring another firm?

366
00:15:18,639 --> 00:15:21,360
If Tengyue Group wants a firm foothold in Honggang,

367
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,600
we must have

368
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,000
our own construction company.

369
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,240
We've done our research.

370
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,200
Changfu Company is the perfect fit.

371
00:15:27,639 --> 00:15:28,759
You know my principle:

372
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,919
I only choose the best and most profitable.

373
00:15:31,799 --> 00:15:32,279
Lawyer Sai,

374
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,039
Tengyue Group's future Honggang investment

375
00:15:35,039 --> 00:15:36,240
will be massive.

376
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:37,879
As for the legal fees,

377
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,879
I'm sure you've crunched the numbers.

378
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,000
I hope you'll choose the best

379
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,200
and most advantageous path.

380
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,000
Any problems?

381
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,480
Bring Changfu on board.

382
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:52,799
You can do it, right?

383
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:05,679
Whatever failed inspection today,

384
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,879
double-check it.

385
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,720
You guys head to Building 2, all right?

386
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:09,679
Stay safe.

387
00:16:09,679 --> 00:16:10,000
Over there!

388
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,879
Stay safe! Hurry up!

389
00:16:11,879 --> 00:16:12,360
Let's go.

390
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,080
Come on, let's move.

391
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,879
Over here, this way!

392
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:14,879
Shut down whatever needs to be shut!

393
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,960
Watch your step! Stay safe!

394
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,519
Xiuming!

395
00:16:17,159 --> 00:16:17,679
Xiuming!

396
00:16:17,879 --> 00:16:18,679
Take it easy, everyone!

397
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:19,639
Over here! Come on, over here!

398
00:16:19,799 --> 00:16:20,600
Qingyou! Qingyou! Qingyou!

399
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:20,960
All right, all right.

400
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,200
Get over here, quick!

401
00:16:23,879 --> 00:16:24,320
Dad.

402
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,000
It's pouring out here.

403
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,799
Don't stand around watching.

404
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:28,919
Hurry up and head back inside.

405
00:16:29,399 --> 00:16:30,559
Things were so bizarre today.

406
00:16:30,879 --> 00:16:32,159
A whole crowd swarmed in out of nowhere.

407
00:16:32,159 --> 00:16:33,960
With all these spot-checks and fixes,

408
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,960
we can't possibly finish tonight.

409
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,440
Xiuming.

410
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:37,960
The rain is too heavy.

411
00:16:38,159 --> 00:16:38,919
We're calling it off for today.

412
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:39,679
Tell everyone to pack up.

413
00:16:39,799 --> 00:16:41,039
We'll deal with it tomorrow once it clears.

414
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:42,879
Tell them to go home.

415
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,639
Just remember this:

416
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:45,000
if we do the job right in the future,

417
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,600
nobody can ever find fault with us.

418
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:47,440
Take this time

419
00:16:47,639 --> 00:16:49,639
as a lesson for the two of us.

420
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:51,559
Send everyone home.

421
00:16:51,799 --> 00:16:52,399
All right, will do.

422
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:53,679
Pack it up, everyone!

423
00:16:53,679 --> 00:16:54,159
Qingyou!

424
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:57,840
Drive the vehicles out! Move them!

425
00:16:58,639 --> 00:16:59,320
Stay safe!

426
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,759
Make sure everything's shut down properly!

427
00:17:01,039 --> 00:17:02,240
Got it, got it! On it!

428
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,720
Let's hurry up and make the rectifications.

429
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,279
Everyone needs to work together

430
00:17:20,279 --> 00:17:21,519
to resolve this as soon as possible.

431
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,240
After all,

432
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,240
we're still waiting on the Phase Three payment.

433
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,519
The way I see it,

434
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:28,559
it won't be that easy.

435
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,559
A friend at Tengyue tipped me off.

436
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,279
He said this whole crackdown

437
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:36,119
was ordered on short notice by someone up top.

438
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,200
You think...

439
00:17:38,039 --> 00:17:38,480
it's him?

440
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:42,079
The second he hung up the phone,

441
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:44,880
he stabbed us in the back this viciously.

442
00:17:45,839 --> 00:17:47,240
Who else could it be?

443
00:17:47,519 --> 00:17:48,720
Just because we turned him down?

444
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,000
Did you really think

445
00:17:52,079 --> 00:17:54,400
he just wanted to buy Changfu?

446
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,799
He came specifically

447
00:17:55,799 --> 00:17:57,559
for what happened all those years ago.

448
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:14,480
Dad?

449
00:18:15,599 --> 00:18:16,319
Dinner's ready.

450
00:18:22,039 --> 00:18:22,440
Dad?

451
00:18:24,119 --> 00:18:24,880
Dinner's ready, Dad.

452
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,039
Dad?

453
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,359
I'm coming in.

454
00:18:41,759 --> 00:18:42,039
Hello.

455
00:18:42,559 --> 00:18:43,119
Come in and take a look.

456
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,480
Looking for an elderly relative?

457
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,319
I'm looking for myself.

458
00:18:49,359 --> 00:18:49,839
For yourself?

459
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,119
Well, take your time.

460
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:52,680
Let me know if you need anything.

461
00:18:53,079 --> 00:18:54,000
Go ahead and get back to work.

462
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:25,960
Dad.

463
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:27,400
Dad, you...

464
00:19:28,519 --> 00:19:29,400
What are you doing here?

465
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:31,920
Dad, you...

466
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,359
About your illness...

467
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:34,400
I kept it a secret.

468
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:35,559
I...

469
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:36,920
I was just worried our family

470
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,839
would end up like Uncle Ma's.

471
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,920
I know what you're thinking.

472
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:43,000
Forget about that.

473
00:19:43,279 --> 00:19:43,960
Come here, come on.

474
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:44,920
Help me take a look.

475
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,240
Which one is better?

476
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:47,559
Take a look at this.

477
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:50,599
They say it's made of fir.

478
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,200
It's affordable and moisture-proof.

479
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:55,039
It really gets damp around here.

480
00:19:55,359 --> 00:19:55,920
And this one.

481
00:19:56,799 --> 00:19:57,960
The wood is thick,

482
00:19:58,319 --> 00:19:59,119
and it looks dignified.

483
00:20:02,319 --> 00:20:04,599
In all my life,

484
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:06,200
I've never bought myself anything decent.

485
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,799
Before I go,

486
00:20:09,039 --> 00:20:10,279
getting something nice...

487
00:20:11,559 --> 00:20:12,279
that's not asking too much, right?

488
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,519
If I look back at my life,

489
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:15,759
having made it this far,

490
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,039
there shouldn't be much left to worry about.

491
00:20:18,359 --> 00:20:19,240
But look,

492
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,720
Xiaowu and Zhenzhu

493
00:20:23,359 --> 00:20:24,279
haven't even taken the college entrance exam.

494
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,200
And our third child

495
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:27,480
doesn't have a partner.

496
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:30,960
Qianjin

497
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:33,359
has such a short temper.

498
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:35,759
The young couple is always bickering.

499
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,160
And your eldest brother,

500
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,400
he can't keep his wife in check.

501
00:20:41,519 --> 00:20:43,160
Now you're in this state, too.

502
00:20:43,519 --> 00:20:45,039
With such a huge mess on my plate,

503
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,960
how could I possibly rest in peace?

504
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:48,640
Dad.

505
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:49,720
Dad.

506
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:50,680
Look,

507
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,920
our top priority right now

508
00:20:53,279 --> 00:20:55,000
is to focus on your treatment.

509
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,119
Let's get you admitted to the hospital first.

510
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:58,640
Medical care has improved so much now.

511
00:20:59,160 --> 00:20:59,799
If Honggang can't treat it,

512
00:20:59,799 --> 00:21:01,440
we'll go to Beijing or Shanghai.

513
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:02,720
You're going to get better.

514
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,240
What if I don't?

515
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:08,680
Son,

516
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,440
Dad needs you right now.

517
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:14,119
I'm here.

518
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,440
Here's what I think.

519
00:21:18,119 --> 00:21:20,279
Since you can't go back to the Port Authority anyway,

520
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:21,960
why don't you come back home?

521
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,640
Close down that law firm,

522
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:26,240
come home, and shoulder this family for me.

523
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:27,400
Besides you,

524
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,599
there's no one else Dad can trust.

525
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,200
Oh, right.

526
00:21:35,519 --> 00:21:36,559
The crew's ledger...

527
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:37,000
Take it.

528
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:37,440
Wait, Dad.

529
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:39,119
What... what are you doing?

530
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:40,200
Just take it.

531
00:21:40,279 --> 00:21:42,119
Why not give it to Big Brother?

532
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:44,119
He can only handle the work.

533
00:21:44,119 --> 00:21:45,359
He can't manage the money.

534
00:21:45,359 --> 00:21:46,200
You have to keep the books.

535
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,480
Then give it to Sister-in-law.

536
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,400
She's too shrewd.

537
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:49,400
Besides, her last name isn't Sai.

538
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,960
Your brother can't control her.

539
00:21:52,279 --> 00:21:52,519
Come on.

540
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:54,079
Just wait until you get better.

541
00:21:54,079 --> 00:21:55,279
Manage it yourself once you're discharged.

542
00:21:55,279 --> 00:21:56,759
What if I don't make it out?

543
00:21:57,559 --> 00:21:58,920
If I don't, for all that time,

544
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,160
no one will be in charge of the family.

545
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:01,359
No one will call the shots.

546
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:03,440
Wouldn't we end up just like the Ma family?

547
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:03,920
Come on, Dad.

548
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:06,319
Why are you so obsessed with this crew?

549
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:08,119
Besides, if you give the ledger to my brother,

550
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,200
they're husband and wife.

551
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:10,400
Does it really matter which one gets it?

552
00:22:10,519 --> 00:22:11,720
Times have changed.

553
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,920
Such family workshops will be phased out.

554
00:22:14,079 --> 00:22:15,480
If it closes, so what? You...

555
00:22:16,359 --> 00:22:18,759
You look down on our bricklaying business,

556
00:22:18,759 --> 00:22:19,160
don't you?

557
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,519
No, Dad.

558
00:22:19,599 --> 00:22:20,599
It's not about looking down on it.

559
00:22:20,599 --> 00:22:22,359
I've already quit my job.

560
00:22:22,519 --> 00:22:24,079
I've already opened my law firm.

561
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,599
You keep dragging me back.

562
00:22:25,599 --> 00:22:26,559
What's the point?

563
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:27,960
You've been like this my whole life.

564
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,839
One minute you tell me to do this,

565
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:29,880
the next you tell me to do that.

566
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,640
Have you ever considered what I want?

567
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:32,680
Take today, for instance.

568
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,759
Aren't you just trying to force me to give in?

569
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:35,680
And if I don't agree,

570
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,480
you'll say I'm unfilial.

571
00:22:36,519 --> 00:22:37,519
Isn't that what this is about?

572
00:22:37,519 --> 00:22:38,359
You're right.

573
00:22:38,359 --> 00:22:39,480
I am forcing you.

574
00:22:39,519 --> 00:22:40,039
So what?

575
00:22:41,079 --> 00:22:42,920
You want to be a respectable gentleman?

576
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:43,960
Don't you forget.

577
00:22:44,119 --> 00:22:45,440
The fancy clothes on your back

578
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:47,880
were bought by our bricklaying business!

579
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,880
You want to ditch this family

580
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,440
and fly off clean on your own?

581
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,279
Let me tell you,

582
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:52,920
not a chance!

583
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,200
As for handing me this ledger,

584
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:54,920
let me tell you too:

585
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:55,920
Not a chance!

586
00:22:56,559 --> 00:22:57,920
Dad, drop the act.

587
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,480
Ground burials aren't even allowed anymore.

588
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,000
Get the hell out!

589
00:23:03,119 --> 00:23:04,559
Get as far away as you can!

590
00:23:20,759 --> 00:23:21,200
Who is it?

591
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:22,279
Dad.

592
00:23:22,839 --> 00:23:23,319
Dinner's ready.

593
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:25,759
I... I'm not hungry.

594
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:26,440
You go ahead and eat.

595
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:30,279
Dad.

596
00:23:33,759 --> 00:23:35,279
At least come out and eat a little.

597
00:23:37,279 --> 00:23:37,920
I'm not hungry.

598
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:38,880
You go ahead and eat.

599
00:23:39,759 --> 00:23:40,680
If you don't eat,

600
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,960
how can the rest of us eat?

601
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,440
No matter what,

602
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,039
you should at least sit there with us.

603
00:23:47,359 --> 00:23:48,559
What happened to your lip?

604
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:51,079
It's nothing.

605
00:23:58,960 --> 00:23:59,440
See that?

606
00:23:59,759 --> 00:24:01,480
Dad, you look way too much like Santa Claus.

607
00:24:03,119 --> 00:24:04,440
Like this, I should climb down chimneys?

608
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,480
Would I even fit?

609
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,599
Definitely not.

610
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:08,720
Remember this.

611
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:09,759
When shaving,

612
00:24:10,079 --> 00:24:11,039
you have to use both hands.

613
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:12,599
One hand holds the razor,

614
00:24:13,039 --> 00:24:15,279
and the other pulls the skin tight.

615
00:24:15,559 --> 00:24:16,720
Then follow the order.

616
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,039
One stroke.

617
00:24:18,519 --> 00:24:19,200
Don't rush.

618
00:24:20,839 --> 00:24:22,319
Never drag it sideways like this.

619
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:24,359
If you do, you'll definitely cut yourself.

620
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:24,839
Got it?

621
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,680
Then under the neck,

622
00:24:27,359 --> 00:24:27,839
same thing.

623
00:24:28,079 --> 00:24:29,119
Tense your mouth a bit

624
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:30,759
to keep the skin tight,

625
00:24:31,519 --> 00:24:32,400
from bottom to top.

626
00:24:33,279 --> 00:24:34,000
One stroke.

627
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:36,640
Under the nose,

628
00:24:36,759 --> 00:24:37,599
around the upper lip here,

629
00:24:37,799 --> 00:24:38,480
it cuts easily.

630
00:24:38,799 --> 00:24:39,160
Same trick,

631
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,160
puff out your cheeks.

632
00:24:44,559 --> 00:24:45,400
Then for the lower lip,

633
00:24:46,119 --> 00:24:48,000
push it from the inside with your tongue.

634
00:24:48,079 --> 00:24:49,079
Dad, go see a doctor.

635
00:24:54,599 --> 00:24:56,400
I still need you to teach me how to shave.

636
00:24:58,319 --> 00:24:59,880
There's still so much you have to teach me.

637
00:26:53,359 --> 00:26:55,359
Sai Duoxi put everything in order

638
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,599
and decided to undergo surgery.

639
00:26:59,559 --> 00:27:00,480
In other matters,

640
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:03,240
his children could share the burden,

641
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:07,599
yet in the ordeal of illness and mortality,

642
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,119
no one could take his place.

643
00:27:11,839 --> 00:27:14,519
Sai Duoxi had to get through it alone.

644
00:27:31,519 --> 00:27:32,240
Xizi,

645
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,720
can these two sheets of paper

646
00:27:35,599 --> 00:27:37,839
really keep this whole family together?

647
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:42,160
Anyway, how the money's split,

648
00:27:43,119 --> 00:27:44,599
who runs the construction crew—

649
00:27:45,799 --> 00:27:47,480
I've written it all out clearly.

650
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,079
Even if I die,

651
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:51,519
this family can't fall apart.

652
00:27:52,759 --> 00:27:53,279
Xizi,

653
00:27:54,079 --> 00:27:55,319
don't take this the wrong way,

654
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:56,799
but when that day really comes,

655
00:27:57,279 --> 00:27:59,440
can you crawl out like a coffin dodger

656
00:28:00,079 --> 00:28:01,200
and keep them all in line?

657
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:02,119
Look at you...

658
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:04,240
If the family falls apart,

659
00:28:05,319 --> 00:28:06,680
in the future, at your grave,

660
00:28:07,759 --> 00:28:10,759
will anyone burn incense and kowtow?

661
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:11,559
You won't even know.

662
00:28:12,279 --> 00:28:13,759
Even if you don't want to hear it,

663
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:14,799
these past few days,

664
00:28:15,359 --> 00:28:16,640
looking at those two sons of yours...

665
00:28:19,359 --> 00:28:20,799
Those two sons of mine...

666
00:28:20,839 --> 00:28:21,920
I don't count on them anymore.

667
00:28:23,279 --> 00:28:24,839
Children will find their own way.

668
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:27,160
Let it go.

669
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,559
Just take things as they come.

670
00:28:34,039 --> 00:28:35,160
This ledger...

671
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:40,200
if I'm on the operating table,

672
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:42,559
find a chance

673
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:44,599
to give it to my second son.

674
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:48,640
Can't you just give it to him yourself?

675
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:51,000
Why drag an outsider like me into this?

676
00:28:51,559 --> 00:28:51,960
Look,

677
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,440
if he were willing to take it,

678
00:28:53,559 --> 00:28:55,240
why would I even come to you?

679
00:28:57,599 --> 00:28:58,279
Dacheng,

680
00:28:58,799 --> 00:29:00,440
besides you right now,

681
00:29:00,839 --> 00:29:02,640
who else can I turn to?

682
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:13,000
Look,

683
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:13,720
Xizi,

684
00:29:14,079 --> 00:29:15,880
you're not just asking me to deliver something.

685
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:17,720
You're... you're having me light a fuse!

686
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:19,720
All hell's bound to break loose!

687
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:20,640
Anyway,

688
00:29:21,799 --> 00:29:22,680
everything that needed to be written,

689
00:29:23,799 --> 00:29:24,440
I've already written down.

690
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:26,640
The eldest runs the family and the construction team.

691
00:29:27,039 --> 00:29:28,279
The second son manages the books and signs off.

692
00:29:29,359 --> 00:29:31,880
The two brothers must team up to run this family.

693
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:33,799
We can't let this family fall apart.

694
00:29:34,039 --> 00:29:36,000
Even if you really put it in his hands,

695
00:29:36,160 --> 00:29:37,240
what could he possibly do?

696
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:13,920
Looking sharp.

697
00:30:15,119 --> 00:30:16,240
It's already the Double Ninth Festival.

698
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:17,200
I told you to change these curtains earlier,

699
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:17,920
to change them earlier!

700
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:18,680
If I don't do it,

701
00:30:18,759 --> 00:30:19,480
nobody will!

702
00:30:19,559 --> 00:30:20,759
I even have to do the men's chores.

703
00:30:21,039 --> 00:30:21,839
All the work in your Sai family...

704
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:22,839
As if I can handle it all by myself!

705
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:23,720
Come on, can you stop

706
00:30:26,519 --> 00:30:27,519
making sarcastic remarks?

707
00:30:27,519 --> 00:30:28,519
Can't you just lend a hand?

708
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:29,599
What else are you good for?

709
00:30:30,839 --> 00:30:31,559
Is your hand okay?

710
00:30:31,720 --> 00:30:32,079
I'm fine.

711
00:30:33,079 --> 00:30:33,839
Smooth it out properly.

712
00:30:33,839 --> 00:30:35,359
Otherwise, I'll have to wind it up again tomorrow.

713
00:30:36,039 --> 00:30:36,440
Big Brother,

714
00:30:36,559 --> 00:30:37,160
I told you,

715
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,480
if you can't do a chore right,

716
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:39,079
you don't have to do it at all.

717
00:30:39,200 --> 00:30:39,599
I—

718
00:30:40,519 --> 00:30:41,000
Don't step on that!

719
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:42,640
You'll ruin it! What are you doing?

720
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:43,400
How else am I supposed to get past?

721
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:44,440
Walk around it!

722
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:45,440
You asked for it.

723
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,640
Wh-What are you doing?

724
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,279
It's just a holiday with Dad.

725
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,559
Why'd you put on so much perfume?

726
00:30:52,559 --> 00:30:53,119
Just because you don't wear perfume

727
00:30:53,119 --> 00:30:53,799
doesn't mean I can't.

728
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,319
You're always so disrespectful!

729
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,920
Who steps right over their older brother?

730
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:57,880
Xiuhe, wait for me!

731
00:30:57,880 --> 00:30:58,599
I'm not ready yet!

732
00:30:58,599 --> 00:31:00,319
Your big brother has to pick up Uncle Ma and the others.

733
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,000
I'll wait in the car.

734
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:01,400
Hurry up, please!

735
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:02,519
Did you hear your sister-in-law?

736
00:31:02,519 --> 00:31:03,119
Get a move on!

737
00:31:03,319 --> 00:31:04,119
Hurry up!

738
00:31:04,119 --> 00:31:05,359
Go get changed!

739
00:31:09,519 --> 00:31:11,119
Stop playing video games all the time.

740
00:31:11,160 --> 00:31:12,480
It's bad for your eyes.

741
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:14,599
Why aren't you taking me?

742
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:16,079
Watch TV,

743
00:31:16,519 --> 00:31:18,079
listen to music, read a book...

744
00:31:18,319 --> 00:31:19,440
Do whatever you want.

745
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:20,319
What about lunch?

746
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,480
Lunch?

747
00:31:30,599 --> 00:31:31,759
I want to eat out.

748
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:32,960
Just give me the money.

749
00:31:40,839 --> 00:31:41,799
Give me some more.

750
00:31:45,559 --> 00:31:46,440
Are you robbing me?

751
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:47,119
What for?

752
00:31:47,119 --> 00:31:48,240
Lu-Lu... Lunch money. Lunch money.

753
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:49,079
This is lunch money.

754
00:31:49,079 --> 00:31:49,839
Besides, it's his money.

755
00:31:49,839 --> 00:31:51,039
It's none of your business.

756
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,880
I just bought these clothes.

757
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:53,799
I haven't even worn them yet.

758
00:31:53,799 --> 00:31:54,119
Qianjin.

759
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:55,039
Take them off right now.

760
00:31:55,039 --> 00:31:56,039
No, I won't.

761
00:31:56,039 --> 00:31:56,759
She just likes your clothes.

762
00:31:56,759 --> 00:31:57,119
Take them off.

763
00:31:57,119 --> 00:31:57,839
She's just trying them on.

764
00:31:57,960 --> 00:31:58,519
Just for fun.

765
00:31:58,519 --> 00:31:59,319
Jin Jingran, I'm telling you.

766
00:31:59,319 --> 00:32:00,640
She has to take them off today.

767
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:01,920
He bought them with his money.

768
00:32:02,279 --> 00:32:03,359
Not yours.

769
00:32:03,359 --> 00:32:04,680
Take them off and give them to Auntie, okay?

770
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,640
I'll buy you a new one.

771
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:06,920
No, I don't want a new one.

772
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:07,839
I just like this one.

773
00:32:07,839 --> 00:32:08,480
Let her wear it for a bit.

774
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:09,920
What's she babbling? I can't understand.

775
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:10,359
No.

776
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:11,359
She says your outfit looks great.

777
00:32:11,359 --> 00:32:11,920
Very stylish.

778
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,079
No, she looks ugly.

779
00:32:13,079 --> 00:32:13,960
You're acting like a teenager.

780
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:15,319
She's definitely insulting me.

781
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:15,960
You—

782
00:32:16,039 --> 00:32:17,319
Ugly.

783
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,960
Stop talking, okay?

784
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,319
She said I don't look good.

785
00:32:20,319 --> 00:32:20,799
You...

786
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:21,480
Get out.

787
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:22,000
Go where?

788
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:22,880
Back to America.

789
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:24,440
No, I'm not planning on going back.

790
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:28,319
I'm going to eighth grade here.

791
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:29,559
Eighth grade?

792
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:30,599
Winter school.

793
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:32,079
Holiday classes, winter break classes.

794
00:32:32,279 --> 00:32:33,480
Look, a kid's education is important.

795
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:34,000
If you have time,

796
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:34,720
help her look for a school.

797
00:32:34,839 --> 00:32:35,880
I'm very busy, all right?

798
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,920
Jin Jingran, I've been too nice to you.

799
00:32:38,079 --> 00:32:39,119
Go to school here?

800
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:40,200
And look for a school for her?

801
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:40,519
No, wait...

802
00:32:40,519 --> 00:32:41,319
In your dreams.

803
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:41,799
Qianjin...

804
00:32:41,799 --> 00:32:43,279
Don't go today.

805
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,759
I'm leaving, I'm leaving.

806
00:32:45,039 --> 00:32:46,079
Jiaqi, eat well, okay?

807
00:32:46,160 --> 00:32:47,680
Call me if anything comes up.

808
00:32:57,640 --> 00:32:58,279
Uncle Ma.

809
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:00,519
Jiao.

810
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:03,640
Brother Xiuming.

811
00:33:04,279 --> 00:33:05,039
We should get going.

812
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:07,200
I'm giving my dad a bath.

813
00:33:12,039 --> 00:33:12,839
Right in the middle of it.

814
00:33:12,839 --> 00:33:14,200
Not done yet. Have a seat first.

815
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:15,240
Tell you what,

816
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:16,119
I'll help.

817
00:33:17,359 --> 00:33:18,319
No, don't!

818
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:19,079
Xiuming.

819
00:33:19,319 --> 00:33:20,519
Don't come in.

820
00:33:20,759 --> 00:33:22,319
You'll get your clothes soaked.

821
00:33:22,559 --> 00:33:23,119
It's fine, Uncle.

822
00:33:23,119 --> 00:33:23,559
You step out.

823
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:24,160
Let me take over.

824
00:33:25,079 --> 00:33:25,640
I'll be quicker.

825
00:33:25,759 --> 00:33:26,119
Here, take this.

826
00:33:26,279 --> 00:33:26,599
Well...

827
00:33:27,119 --> 00:33:27,559
Uncle.

828
00:33:28,319 --> 00:33:29,119
Let me do it, Uncle.

829
00:33:29,119 --> 00:33:30,240
I hate troubling you with this.

830
00:33:30,359 --> 00:33:31,599
I'm faster than Jiao.

831
00:33:32,759 --> 00:33:33,440
Really, you shouldn't have.

832
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,240
No need to be polite.

833
00:33:34,359 --> 00:33:35,039
Don't stand on ceremony.

834
00:33:36,359 --> 00:33:36,720
Jiao,

835
00:33:37,839 --> 00:33:39,400
make sure you shut that door tight.

836
00:33:41,079 --> 00:33:42,599
You're so thoughtful.

837
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:43,960
Xiuming,

838
00:33:44,839 --> 00:33:45,400
tell me,

839
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:47,759
how did your dad raise you?

840
00:33:48,759 --> 00:33:49,319
You're

841
00:33:49,559 --> 00:33:51,599
so filial and capable.

842
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:52,759
Why don't you

843
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:55,880
just be my son in our next life?

844
00:33:56,119 --> 00:33:56,640
How about this:

845
00:33:57,319 --> 00:33:58,759
when the time comes, on my back,

846
00:33:59,079 --> 00:34:00,000
you tattoo a mark on me.

847
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:01,240
That way, next time around,

848
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,759
we'll easily find each other.

849
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,199
Come on,

850
00:34:11,599 --> 00:34:12,119
this way, this way.

851
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,000
Park over here.

852
00:34:14,119 --> 00:34:14,400
All right.

853
00:34:15,559 --> 00:34:16,079
Director Jin.

854
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:16,920
Hello, hello!

855
00:34:18,239 --> 00:34:18,719
Qianjin.

856
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:20,719
Director Jin,

857
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,800
I've finally caught you today!

858
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,159
You were always busy when I invited you.

859
00:34:24,599 --> 00:34:25,400
Today is our family dinner.

860
00:34:25,639 --> 00:34:26,199
The two of us brothers

861
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,400
must have a proper drink together.

862
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:28,920
I'm the deputy. Deputy director.

863
00:34:29,119 --> 00:34:30,199
I'm on duty today,

864
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:30,840
so I can't drink.

865
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:31,639
I have to drive.

866
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:32,760
Uncle Wei.

867
00:34:33,039 --> 00:34:33,360
Brother.

868
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:35,280
Auntie!

869
00:34:35,639 --> 00:34:36,800
Zhenzhu!

870
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,880
Auntie, did you bring my Xi Zhi Lang jelly?

871
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:40,480
I forgot it today.

872
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:41,320
I'll bring it next time, okay?

873
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:41,679
Okay.

874
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:42,320
Director Jin,

875
00:34:42,639 --> 00:34:43,000
actually,

876
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,000
I'd still really like

877
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,800
to introduce you to our company's

878
00:34:46,079 --> 00:34:47,000
newly imported

879
00:34:47,119 --> 00:34:48,280
specific medication for heart disease.

880
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:48,840
Let's talk another day.

881
00:34:49,079 --> 00:34:50,000
It's improper to keep our elders waiting.

882
00:34:50,119 --> 00:34:50,440
Let's go.

883
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:51,119
Together.

884
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:52,280
"Director Jin."

885
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:56,320
Who does he think he is, putting on airs?

886
00:34:56,599 --> 00:34:57,559
Acting high and mighty won't put food on the table.

887
00:35:06,320 --> 00:35:06,760
Old man,

888
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:07,519
you guys go on in.

889
00:35:07,519 --> 00:35:08,199
Let me make a phone call.

890
00:35:15,719 --> 00:35:16,840
You're being too modest.

891
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:17,760
Look at this, really...

892
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:18,320
Grandpa!

893
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:18,760
Dad!

894
00:35:19,679 --> 00:35:20,599
How did you two get here?

895
00:35:20,679 --> 00:35:21,320
Sai Xiuli took a cab.

896
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:21,760
Uncle Wei.

897
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:23,239
You made it!

898
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:23,679
Dad.

899
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:25,159
"Xiuli, Xiuli"—where are your manners?

900
00:35:25,159 --> 00:35:25,519
Brother Wei.

901
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:31,079
Hey there.

902
00:35:32,079 --> 00:35:33,079
All this sweet talk out of nowhere...

903
00:35:33,199 --> 00:35:33,639
What are you after?

904
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:34,440
I came to see you.

905
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,199
Just wanted to pick you up.

906
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:36,719
I'm not falling for that.

907
00:35:37,039 --> 00:35:37,840
I'm broke right now.

908
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:38,360
This is all I've got to offer.

909
00:35:39,719 --> 00:35:40,679
But I'm a growth stock.

910
00:35:40,679 --> 00:35:41,519
You can invest in me.

911
00:35:41,639 --> 00:35:42,400
Guaranteed profit, zero risk!

912
00:35:42,519 --> 00:35:42,960
I promise.

913
00:35:43,719 --> 00:35:44,119
You?

914
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:45,599
A growth stock?

915
00:35:45,719 --> 00:35:46,119
That's right.

916
00:35:47,199 --> 00:35:48,760
Who was it, a man in his thirties,

917
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:50,199
crying his eyes out, all snot and tears?

918
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:54,440
"Dad, you're right.

919
00:35:55,199 --> 00:35:56,400
I'm just an ungrateful wretch.

920
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,599
I... I even wanted a share of the money.

921
00:35:58,599 --> 00:35:59,000
Keep your voice down.

922
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,480
I'm just an unfilial son!"

923
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,199
Stop talking!

924
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:02,760
What else did I say?

925
00:36:03,039 --> 00:36:04,280
Everything, appropriate or not...

926
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:04,760
you spilled it all.

927
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:06,519
How much money your dad got,

928
00:36:06,519 --> 00:36:07,639
what should happen to the construction team...

929
00:36:08,559 --> 00:36:09,000
You blabbed about everything.

930
00:36:09,079 --> 00:36:10,000
I actually told you all that?

931
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:11,960
Am I really that big of a blabbermouth?

932
00:36:12,559 --> 00:36:13,880
I'm that terrible when I drink?

933
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:14,920
Sai Xiuhe,

934
00:36:15,559 --> 00:36:16,440
you're actually a pretty good guy.

935
00:36:17,079 --> 00:36:17,480
Cut the act.

936
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:22,480
Let me tell you something.

937
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,280
Don't rush to buy that house from the other day.

938
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:25,400
I found a better one for you.

939
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:25,960
Wait for my word.

940
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:28,000
Your third son seems pretty close to his aunt.

941
00:36:30,159 --> 00:36:31,719
Isn't he recently...

942
00:36:31,719 --> 00:36:32,599
working at Laibu's place?

943
00:36:33,159 --> 00:36:33,719
Probably.

944
00:36:34,199 --> 00:36:35,000
They see each other often.

945
00:36:42,599 --> 00:36:44,480
Why didn't Xiuliang and his wife come?

946
00:36:46,079 --> 00:36:47,920
Well, they're both busy at work today,

947
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:49,559
so they won't make it.

948
00:36:49,559 --> 00:36:50,079
Right, exactly.

949
00:36:51,719 --> 00:36:52,440
That should be everyone.

950
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:53,360
Let's...

951
00:36:53,679 --> 00:36:54,079
get started.

952
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:57,480
Between the two of you,

953
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:58,480
who goes first?

954
00:37:00,039 --> 00:37:00,760
Brother Qi, of course.

955
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:01,400
He's older than me.

956
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,719
Going by age,

957
00:37:03,559 --> 00:37:04,199
Brother Qi should speak.

958
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:04,840
Brother Qi,

959
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:05,559
you go ahead.

960
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:08,719
You ignored seniority splitting the estate,

961
00:37:09,199 --> 00:37:10,639
but now you suddenly care about tradition?

962
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:11,599
If you don't want to eat, get the hell out!

963
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:23,360
All right.

964
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:25,719
Then let's stick to tradition.

965
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,440
Today is the Double Ninth Festival.

966
00:37:29,679 --> 00:37:31,000
Uncle Duoxi went to the trouble

967
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,000
of bringing Uncle Wei,

968
00:37:32,119 --> 00:37:34,920
and the Sai and Ma families together under one roof.

969
00:37:35,119 --> 00:37:35,599
First of all,

970
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:36,639
standing right here,

971
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:37,599
I'd like to sincerely wish

972
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:38,639
our three elders

973
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:39,599
good health

974
00:37:39,960 --> 00:37:40,679
and a long life.

975
00:37:41,119 --> 00:37:41,639
Well said!

976
00:37:45,599 --> 00:37:47,159
On this Double Ninth Festival,

977
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,760
we honor, love, and respect our elders.

978
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,119
So we of the younger generation

979
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:52,119
must strive to do our very best.

980
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:54,679
And some of the youngsters at this table...

981
00:37:55,159 --> 00:37:56,360
need to learn some sense,

982
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:58,559
and appreciate the elders' hardships.

983
00:37:59,280 --> 00:38:00,840
Then again,

984
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:02,920
the elders should lead by example, too.

985
00:38:03,239 --> 00:38:03,760
Your heart

986
00:38:04,159 --> 00:38:04,719
must be upright,

987
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:05,480
and fair.

988
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:07,039
Matters must be handled with justice.

989
00:38:07,679 --> 00:38:09,119
Only then will your children's filial piety

990
00:38:09,320 --> 00:38:11,000
come from the bottom of their hearts,

991
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:12,159
pure and genuine.

992
00:38:12,599 --> 00:38:13,840
Ma Laiqi, let me warn you.

993
00:38:14,239 --> 00:38:15,119
On a big holiday like this,

994
00:38:15,519 --> 00:38:16,840
don't go looking for trouble.

995
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:18,400
Fine.

996
00:38:18,639 --> 00:38:19,639
Let him speak.

997
00:38:19,639 --> 00:38:20,280
We're listening.

998
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,280
What are you talking about?

999
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,639
What does this have to do with you?

1000
00:38:22,920 --> 00:38:24,239
Hey, did you eat gunpowder today?

1001
00:38:24,239 --> 00:38:24,880
What gunpowder?

1002
00:38:24,960 --> 00:38:25,920
I'm your boss!

1003
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:27,360
Have you lost your damn mind today?

1004
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,519
Who are you saying has lost their mind?

1005
00:38:28,679 --> 00:38:29,400
Ma Laosan!

1006
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:30,800
You're way out of line!

1007
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:31,719
Sit down!

1008
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,400
Anyway,

1009
00:38:37,039 --> 00:38:38,239
I wish our three families

1010
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:39,280
good health

1011
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:40,159
and lasting harmony.

1012
00:38:40,559 --> 00:38:41,000
Cheers!

1013
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:41,679
Cheers!

1014
00:38:41,719 --> 00:38:42,280
Yes, exactly.

1015
00:38:42,599 --> 00:38:44,079
Dad, Uncle Wei, Uncle Ma, happy holiday!

1016
00:38:44,079 --> 00:38:44,679
Old man,

1017
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,239
Uncle Wei, Uncle Ma,

1018
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:46,639
Dad,

1019
00:38:46,639 --> 00:38:47,239
happy holiday!

1020
00:38:47,239 --> 00:38:48,280
Good health,

1021
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:49,119
and a speedy recovery.

1022
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,480
Dad, happy holiday!

1023
00:38:50,519 --> 00:38:51,280
All right, all right!

1024
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:56,800
Well,

1025
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,000
let me say a few words.

1026
00:38:58,119 --> 00:38:58,440
Go ahead.

1027
00:39:00,039 --> 00:39:01,599
I called everyone

1028
00:39:02,159 --> 00:39:02,840
here today

1029
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:04,159
to discuss two things.

1030
00:39:04,719 --> 00:39:05,800
First,

1031
00:39:06,079 --> 00:39:07,480
it's about my illness.

1032
00:39:08,559 --> 00:39:09,719
Earlier on,

1033
00:39:09,719 --> 00:39:11,920
things at the site and at home

1034
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:13,440
weren't sorted out yet,

1035
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:16,159
so I kept putting off treatment.

1036
00:39:16,760 --> 00:39:17,800
Now they're pretty much handled,

1037
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:20,000
so I've

1038
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:20,960
decided

1039
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:22,320
to check into the hospital

1040
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:23,440
and get the surgery.

1041
00:39:23,800 --> 00:39:24,320
Good, good.

1042
00:39:25,559 --> 00:39:26,000
Jingran.

1043
00:39:26,559 --> 00:39:26,800
Dad.

1044
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:27,199
This matter,

1045
00:39:27,519 --> 00:39:28,360
I'm counting on you.

1046
00:39:28,639 --> 00:39:29,039
Don't worry, Dad.

1047
00:39:29,039 --> 00:39:29,320
Old man...

1048
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,400
Wait, didn't we talk about Chinese medicine?

1049
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:31,320
Think... think it over.

1050
00:39:31,320 --> 00:39:32,360
Enough, shut up.

1051
00:39:32,679 --> 00:39:33,639
No, think again. We...

1052
00:39:33,639 --> 00:39:35,119
The surgery is settled. That's final.

1053
00:39:36,079 --> 00:39:37,280
As for the second thing,

1054
00:39:37,519 --> 00:39:39,000
I want to tell everyone that

1055
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:40,199
in case...

1056
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:43,840
I—I mean, just in case,

1057
00:39:44,199 --> 00:39:45,960
if I have the surgery

1058
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:47,800
and don't make it off the table,

1059
00:39:48,039 --> 00:39:49,159
our family

1060
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:50,880
must not fall apart.

1061
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:52,440
We can't let

1062
00:39:52,719 --> 00:39:54,679
an elder passing away

1063
00:39:55,519 --> 00:39:56,679
tear the family apart.

1064
00:39:57,039 --> 00:39:57,719
That won't do.

1065
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:00,000
So,

1066
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:01,559
the three of us old men

1067
00:40:02,199 --> 00:40:02,800
have decided

1068
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,199
that our three families

1069
00:40:04,920 --> 00:40:06,239
will band together,

1070
00:40:06,639 --> 00:40:07,800
sharing the good times

1071
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:09,679
and weathering the bad together.

1072
00:40:16,519 --> 00:40:17,039
Uncle Duoxi,

1073
00:40:17,679 --> 00:40:18,039
well,

1074
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,079
all three families

1075
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,239
teaming up...

1076
00:40:20,239 --> 00:40:21,000
How exactly

1077
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,639
is that going to work?

1078
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:23,679
Wait,

1079
00:40:24,039 --> 00:40:24,360
Dad,

1080
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:25,679
for something this big,

1081
00:40:25,679 --> 00:40:27,480
why didn't you talk to us first?

1082
00:40:28,079 --> 00:40:28,400
Dad,

1083
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:29,639
do you mean

1084
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:31,599
our family and Uncle Ma's

1085
00:40:31,880 --> 00:40:33,079
will merge into Uncle Wei's?

1086
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:34,280
No, what is the old man getting at?

1087
00:40:34,360 --> 00:40:36,039
Keep pouring money into the team, right?

1088
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:36,760
Wait,

1089
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:37,199
hold on...

1090
00:40:37,199 --> 00:40:37,760
Duoxi,

1091
00:40:40,079 --> 00:40:42,320
we haven't even talked this through.

1092
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:44,239
You're deciding just like that?

1093
00:40:44,639 --> 00:40:46,119
We still need to discuss it.

1094
00:40:46,519 --> 00:40:47,039
Brother Wei,

1095
00:40:47,679 --> 00:40:50,000
in front of the kids today,

1096
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:52,320
let me speak from the heart.

1097
00:40:52,679 --> 00:40:53,079
Go ahead.

1098
00:40:53,559 --> 00:40:54,519
Old Ma and I,

1099
00:40:54,639 --> 00:40:55,719
our two families,

1100
00:40:56,239 --> 00:40:58,039
here in Qingyangli,

1101
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,199
have done pretty well for ourselves.

1102
00:41:00,039 --> 00:41:00,480
That's true.

1103
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:03,159
But it's not because

1104
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:04,440
the two of us are so capable.

1105
00:41:04,679 --> 00:41:06,320
It's all because of you.

1106
00:41:06,639 --> 00:41:07,480
No, don't say that.

1107
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:08,320
Without you,

1108
00:41:08,519 --> 00:41:10,679
neither of our families would be here today.

1109
00:41:10,679 --> 00:41:11,960
Xizi is right.

1110
00:41:12,519 --> 00:41:13,360
Back in the day...

1111
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,039
Look at you...

1112
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:21,039
The younger folks don't know this.

1113
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:25,159
Back then, I didn't have a penny to my name.

1114
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:29,039
Uncle Wei gave me my first seed money.

1115
00:41:30,239 --> 00:41:31,559
Xizi, back then,

1116
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:34,000
you couldn't even tell

1117
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,079
cement grades apart.

1118
00:41:35,760 --> 00:41:37,880
Old Wei taught you step by step, right?

1119
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:38,840
Yes, absolutely.

1120
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:42,400
So today, no matter what the kids think,

1121
00:41:43,039 --> 00:41:44,360
whether they agree

1122
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:45,559
or support it,

1123
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:46,880
the three of us

1124
00:41:47,599 --> 00:41:48,840
must stick together.

1125
00:41:49,960 --> 00:41:51,360
This isn't business.

1126
00:41:51,880 --> 00:41:53,559
This is about brotherhood.

1127
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:54,440
Brother Wei.

1128
00:42:12,199 --> 00:42:12,679
Brother Wei,

1129
00:42:15,440 --> 00:42:17,440
you're... you're really putting me on the spot.

1130
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:20,159
All right.

1131
00:42:20,320 --> 00:42:21,840
Since both of you have put it this way,

1132
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:22,559
then I'll...

1133
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:24,840
make my stance clear right here.

1134
00:42:25,679 --> 00:42:26,760
Xizi is about to have his surgery.

1135
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:29,119
No matter what happens next,

1136
00:42:29,639 --> 00:42:30,079
I

1137
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:32,639
will definitely carry our three families

1138
00:42:32,719 --> 00:42:33,239
forward.

1139
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:35,400
As long as I have breath in me,

1140
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:36,960
I won't let us fall apart.

1141
00:42:37,159 --> 00:42:38,159
As long as I have something,

1142
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:39,119
you'll have your share.

1143
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:40,440
That's wonderful.

1144
00:42:40,760 --> 00:42:42,239
We'll become one big family.

1145
00:42:42,239 --> 00:42:43,360
Great, great.

1146
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:44,800
Xiuming, say... say something.

1147
00:42:44,800 --> 00:42:45,360
Right, right.

1148
00:42:45,639 --> 00:42:47,679
Wait. In this new company,

1149
00:42:47,679 --> 00:42:49,400
how are shares split among the three families?

1150
00:42:50,199 --> 00:42:51,679
Who's the legal representative?

1151
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:52,599
Who gets the biggest cut?

1152
00:42:53,039 --> 00:42:53,320
Dad,

1153
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:55,000
have you thought all this through?

1154
00:42:55,559 --> 00:42:57,599
Uncle Wei has run a company for years.

1155
00:42:57,840 --> 00:42:58,519
He has plenty of experience.

1156
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:00,400
We'll just follow his lead,

1157
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:00,880
and that's that.

1158
00:43:01,119 --> 00:43:01,920
Even if we do it,

1159
00:43:03,159 --> 00:43:04,119
who's running things?

1160
00:43:06,079 --> 00:43:06,599
Xiuming.

1161
00:43:07,079 --> 00:43:09,239
Xiuming knows the ropes around the site.

1162
00:43:09,440 --> 00:43:10,119
Legal rep?

1163
00:43:10,280 --> 00:43:11,480
He... he can do it.

1164
00:43:20,039 --> 00:43:22,000
People say to take life and death lightly,

1165
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:24,840
but when it comes down to life or death,

1166
00:43:25,719 --> 00:43:27,800
no one can truly brush it aside.

1167
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:30,480
What are you doing?

1168
00:43:31,360 --> 00:43:33,599
Playing tough with our dad when he has cancer?

1169
00:43:33,719 --> 00:43:34,360
Go to sleep.

1170
00:43:35,519 --> 00:43:35,880
Turn off the light.

1171
00:43:37,920 --> 00:43:39,480
Listen, is there a noise coming from Dad's room?

1172
00:43:40,239 --> 00:43:41,000
Listen... listen.
